e  strategy in planning  so for assuming that this game is more  difficult at launch then the draw is  earning  xp to unlock react gear and explosives  you'll be familiar with react explosives  as far as we can tell the only one that  does something  drastically different than in rainbow  six siege are smoke grenades which now  drive aliens out of cover otherwise it's  the standard fare of claymores impact  grenades frags and stuns react gear has  the potential to help players out at  higher threat settings  but it mostly boils down to more ammo  more explosives  armor or a recon drone it feels like  this category needs a bit more  creative thought most players will  naturally gravitate towards the armor  which seems to have the most benefits by  reducing damage and keeping players from  quickly dying when they go down  having the drone be a choice and not a  default probably means it'll rarely get  picked unless you're doing some kind of  mandatory stealth objective  but even then you can just pick vigil  who cloaks and can easily take on  stealth objectives without having to  sacrifice some other gear for the drone  as this game is further developed it'd  be good to see some less standard and  more creative options in the gear  category  two extractions credit directional sound  design is very good and you don't really  need a drone to understand what's around  you maps are full of nests sprawl and  different alien types you battle while  chasing objectives  we played the game on incursion mode  which has up to three sub maps you can  tackle by going through airlocks and  restarting a 15 minute timer  you can extract it anytime but the more  sub maps you tackle the better the xp  gets  objectives are randomly chosen from a  pretty huge list with the exception of  rescue teammate which automatically  triggers if someone goes down and is  captured  one funny thing to note is that the  extraction refers to you extracting your  own dead  characters if you successfully